        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_3",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_4",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_5",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_6",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_8",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_9",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_10"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "In this Act, unless the context otherwise requires— \"administrator\" means a person who—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_1",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_1__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_1__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_10",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "10",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_10__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_10__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_10__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "as principal, agrees to purchase shares issued by a mutual fund with a view to offering them to the public; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_10__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "as agent of a mutual fund, offers for sale or sells to the public shares issued by the mutual fund; \"unit trust\" means any trust established under the laws of Malaysia relating to Labuan or the laws of any recognised country or jurisdiction for the purpose, or having the effect, of providing facilities for the participation by persons as beneficiaries under the trust in any profits or income arising from the acquisition, holding, management or disposal of any property."
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_1__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "for valuable consideration provides a mutual fund with administrative services or facilities alone or with accounting services; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_1__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is entitled to provide a mutual fund with such services or facilities under any recognised country or jurisdiction, and includes an offshore bank, a trust company and a management company licensed under section 130c of the Offshore Companies Act 1990; \"auditor\" means a person qualified to perform audits under the laws of Malaysia or any recognised country or jurisdiction and approved by the Authority; \"Authority\" has the meaning assigned to it in the Labuan Offshore Financial Services Authority Act 1996; \"business day\" means a day during any part of which the facilities of the Exchange are available to its trading members for trading purposes or would have been available but for a suspension of trading ordered by the Authority under section 38; \"by-laws\" means the written terms by reference to which the committee regulates its own procedure and includes such terms applicable thereto as contained in the memorandum and articles of association of the Exchange; \"committee\" means the persons in whom for the time being the management of the Exchange is vested; \"company\" means a body corporate wherever incorporated or constituted; \"court\" means a court of competent jurisdiction; \"custodian\" means the person who is entrusted by a mutual fund with custody of the property of the fund pursuant to an agreement to that effect; \"dealing in securities\" means, whether as principal or agent, making or offering to make with any person or inducing or attempting to induce any person to enter into or to offer to enter into—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_2",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "2",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_2__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_2__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_2__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any agreement for or with a view to acquiring, disposing of, subscribing for, or underwriting securities; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_2__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_2",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any agreement the purpose or avowed purpose of which is to secure a profit to any of the parties from the yield of securities or by reference to fluctuations in the value of securities; \"Exchange\" means the body corporate established as a securities exchange under section 30; \"expert\" includes any engineer, accountant, solicitor, valuer, auditor or any other person whose profession or reputation gives authority to a statement made by him; \"financial year\" means the period not exceeding fifty- three weeks at the end of which the balance of the fund's accounts is struck or, if no such balance is struck or if the period of fifty-three weeks for so doing is exceeded, the calendar year; \"investor\" means a person who owns, or has an interest, in shares issued by a mutual fund but does not include a promoter or an operator; \"listing requirements\" means the rules governing or relating to—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_3",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "3",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_3__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_3__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_3__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the admission to the official list of the Exchange of any body corporate, government, unincorporated body or any other person for the purpose of quotation on the securities market and removal therefrom; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_3__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_3",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "the activities or conduct of any body corporate, government, unincorporated body and any other person admitted to that list who have been approved by the Authority; \"manager\" means a person who—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_4",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "4",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_4__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_4__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_4__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "for valuable consideration provides management services alone or with investment advice or administrative services in respect of securities for the purposes of investment, including dealing in securities or such other activity as may be prescribed by the Authority; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_4__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_4",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "is entitled to provide such services or advice under the laws of any recognised country or jurisdiction; \"Minister\" means the Minister for the time being charged with the responsibility for finance; \"mutual fund\" or \"fund\" means an offshore company or a company incorporated under the laws of any recognised country or jurisdiction, partnership or a unit trust which—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_5",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "5",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_5__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_5__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_5__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "collects and pools funds for the purpose of collective investment with the aim of spreading investment risk; and"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_5__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_5",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "issues shares which entitle the holder to receive on demand or within a specified period after demand an amount computed by reference to the value of a proportionate interest in the whole or part of the net assets of the company, partnership or unit trust, as the case may be, and includes an umbrella fund whose shares are split into a number of different class funds or sub-funds and participants in which are entitled to exchange rights in one part for rights in another; \"offshore bank\" means a bank licensed under subsection 6(2) of the Offshore Banking Act 1990; \"offshore company\" has the meaning assigned to it in the Offshore Companies Act 1990; \"operator\", in respect of a mutual fund, means—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_6",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "6",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_6__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_6__para_b",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_6__para_c"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_6__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the mutual fund is a company, a director of that company; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the mutual fund is a partnership, a general partner in that partnership; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_6__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "where the mutual fund is a unit trust, a trustee of that trust; \"partnership\" means a partnership formed under the Labuan Offshore Limited Partnerships Act 1997 or under the laws of any recognised country or jurisdiction notwithstanding any statutory definition to the contrary; \"person\" includes a mutual fund, an offshore company, a partnership, a unit trust and a body of persons, whether incorporated or unincorporated; \"prescribed\" means prescribed by the Authority under this Act, and where no mode is mentioned, means prescribed by order published in the Gazette; \"private fund\" means a mutual fund—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7__para_a",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7__para_b"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7__para_a",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "a",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7__para_a__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7__para_a__subpara_ii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "whose shares are not offered to the general public and are owned or held by—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7__para_a__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "not more than one hundred investors where the first time investment of each of such investors is not less than one hundred thousand ringgit (or such other sum as may be prescribed) or the equivalent in any other currency;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7__para_a__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7__para_a",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "any number of investors where the first time investment of each of such investors is not less than five hundred thousand ringgit (or such other sum as may be prescribed) or the equivalent in any other currency; or"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_7",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "which is designated as a private fund under section 50; \"promoter\" means a person acting alone or in conjunction with others directly or indirectly who takes the initiative in forming or organising the business of a mutual fund, but does not include a custodian or an underwriter who receives underwriting commission without taking part in the founding or organising of the mutual fund business; \"prospectus\" means any prospectus, notice, circular, advertisement, information, memorandum or other written invitation offering to the public for subscription or purchase any shares issued by a mutual fund; \"public fund\" means a mutual fund other than a private fund which, by means of publishing or distributing a prospectus or by any other means, offers any shares issued by it for subscription or purchase to any member of the general public; \"recognised country or jurisdiction\" has the meaning assigned to it under subsection 3(3); \"record\" means a facility for storing information which can be subsequently retrieved or reproduced; \"registered public fund\" means a public fund registered under section 11; \"regulations\" means regulations made under this Act; \"rules\", in relation to the Exchange, means the rules governing the conduct of the Exchange or the members thereof; \"shares\" means one or more of the shares in the share capital of a mutual fund company including, in the case of a company limited by guarantee, the interest of a member of such company and includes an interest in a mutual fund partnership and a unit in a mutual fund unit trust; \"secretary\" means the secretary for the time being of the Exchange and includes an acting or assistant secretary; \"securities\" means any investments commonly known or capable of being described as securities, and includes—"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_8",
      "@type": "akn:list",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/48/eng@/~part_I__cl_2__subsec_1__list_8__para_a",
